Algorithm:

The steps below show how the base would work some admin features would be later added:

Step 1: We start with 
  1. Load all inventory records and ledger data from local files (.dat or .txt) into memory.
  2. WHILE True:
       DISPLAY Main Menu:
         [1] Login as Admin
         [2] Login as Pharmacist / Billing Operator
         [3] Exit Program
       READ choice
       IF choice == 1:
           CALL Admin_Module()
       ELSE IF choice == 2:
           CALL Billing_Module()
       ELSE IF choice == 3:
           Save all current memory data back to files.
           PRINT "Exiting program. Goodbye!"
           BREAK
       ELSE:
           PRINT "Invalid choice, try again."
END


Step 2: If admin is selected, then
FUNCTION Admin_Module():
  PRINT "Enter Admin Password: "
  READ input_password
  IF input_password != CORRECT_PASSWORD:
      PRINT "Access Denied!"
      RETURN
  
  WHILE True:
       DISPLAY Admin Menu:
         [1] Add New Medicine
         [2] Update/Delete Medicine Record
         [3] View Low-Stock & Expiry Alerts
         [4] View Total Revenue & Sales Report
         [5] Logout (Return to Main Menu)
       READ admin_choice
       
       SWITCH admin_choice:
           CASE 1: 
               Prompt for medicine details (ID, name, price, qty, expiry).
               Append new record to array/linked list and update file.
           CASE 2:
               Search medicine by ID/Name, modify fields, or mark as deleted.
               Rewrite updated list to file.
           CASE 3:
               Scan inventory array for quantities < threshold OR expiry date <= current date.
               Display warning alerts.
           CASE 4:
               Read sales/ledger file, calculate and display total revenue.
           CASE 5:
               BREAK (Logout)


Step 3: if billing operator then 
FUNCTION Billing_Module():
  INITIALIZE cart (array of items with ID, quantity to buy)
  INITIALIZE total_cost = 0

  WHILE True:
       DISPLAY Billing Menu:
         [1] Search Medicine & Add to Cart
         [2] View Cart & Total
         [3] Checkout & Print Bill
         [4] Cancel / Return to Main Menu
       READ bill_choice

       IF bill_choice == 1:
           PRINT "Enter medicine name or ID to search:"
           READ search_query
           SEARCH inventory for search_query.
           IF found:
               DISPLAY medicine details & available stock.
               PRINT "Enter quantity to buy:"
               READ buy_qty
               IF buy_qty <= available_stock:
                   Add item to cart.
                   UPDATE temporary total.
               ELSE:
                   PRINT "Error: Insufficient stock!"
           ELSE:
               PRINT "Medicine not found."

       ELSE IF bill_choice == 2:
           DISPLAY items currently in cart and running total.

       ELSE IF bill_choice == 3:
           IF cart is empty:
               PRINT "Cart is empty!"
               CONTINUE
           
           PRINT "Enter Customer Name & Phone Number:"
           READ cust_name, cust_phone
           
           FOR each item in cart:
               Subtract item.quantity from main inventory quantity.
               Append transaction record to customer prescription ledger file.
           
           Generate formatted text receipt (console display + export to receipt.txt).
           Save updated inventory back to data file.
           CLEAR cart.
           PRINT "Checkout successful!"

       ELSE IF bill_choice == 4:
           BREAK

